Huong dan cau hinh Spring Security cho Spring Boot WebAPI

1. Spring Security
   Spring Security la Framework thuoc he sinh thai cua Spring Java.
   Spring Security trong web API/MVC duoc xem la Layer 1 cua ung dung Spring Java
   Nhiem vu cua Spring Security:
        + Xac thuc nguoi dung - Authentication
        + Phan quyen nguoi dung - Authorization

          => Xac thuc Request truoc khi request den layer tiep theo la controller.

2. Cau hinh Spring Security
   Spring Security quan ly cau hinh thong qua cac annotation:
        + @Bean              -> Quan ly doi tuong, injections va dao nguoc quyen quan ly (IOC)
        + @Configuration     -> Danh dau la mot lop cau hinh
        + @Component         -> Danh dau la lop thanh phan thuoc lop cau hinh @Coniguration

   Cac lop cau hinh voi annotation @Configuration gom nhieu methods, moi method phai duoc danh dau bang @Bean.
   Moi mot method co the tach rieng thanh cac lop cau hinh @Configuration rieng biet, dieu nay giup cho viec quan ly va
   bao tri de dang hon neu nhu phat sinh cac cau hinh phuc tap va can xu ly chuyen sau.

   Khi cau hinh Spring Seecurity cho webApi, cac methods can thiet nhu:

        + @Bean
          public SecurityFilterChain securityFilterChain(HttpSecurity http)
          Chuoi filter chinh cua Spring Security, gom hang loat cac cau hinh ben trong chuoi xu ly filter cua Spring Security

        + @Bean
          public BCryptPasswordEncoder bCryptPasswordEncoder()
          Chiu trach nhiem decode va encode mat khau nguoi dung

        + @Bean
          public AuthenticationManager manager(AuthenticationConfiguration config)
          Quan ly xac thuc nguoi dung

        + @Bean
          public AuthenticationProvider authenticationProvider()
          Cung cap du lieu nguoi dung tu DB de xac thuc

        + @Bean
          public CorsConfigurationSource corsConfigurationSource()
          Cau hinh Cors Origin cho client khi truy cap tai nguyen cua WebApi.

   Trong 5 phuong thuc cau hinh tren, SecurityFilterChain la cau hinh chinh bao gom nhieu cau hinh ben trong phuc vu cho
   chuoi xu ly filter du lieu nguoi dung.

   Toan bo noi dung trong package "springWeb" la cau hinh theo tieu chuan cua webApi co dung JWT. Co the ap dung package
   "springWeb" cho bat ky du an nao. Co the thay doi noi dung trong lop cau hinh va component:
        + @Component CustomUserDetailService:
            Co the thay doi username hoac email hoac bat ky thong tin gi can xac thuc

        + @Configuration CorsConfigurations:
            Co the thay doi origin client phu hop voi webApi cho phep truy cap hoac cac thong tin can thiet khac

        + @Configuration SecurityConfiguration:
            Co the thay doi noi dung permission trong cau hinh authorizeHttpRequests() cua SpringFilterChains


